[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3748373672","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114899#issuecomment-3748373672","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114899","id":3748373672,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7fa6So","user":{"login":"LucaTuerk","id":15263030,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MjYzMDMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15263030?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucaTuerk","html_url":"https://github.com/LucaTuerk","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucaTuerk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucaTuerk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucaTuerk/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucaTuerk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucaTuerk/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucaTuerk/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucaTuerk/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucaTuerk/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucaTuerk/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-14T08:21:48Z","updated_at":"2026-01-14T08:23:51Z","body":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/481f36ed20520db3195a09cc309abf48c03cf51a/drivers/gles3/storage/texture_storage.cpp#L2496\n\nThis is the offending code snippet. The back buffer cannot be created because the 41x41 limit is enforced by the texture storage. It also seems to works for the MRP to change the limit here, but it still seems oddly specific and i'm unsure as to the reasoning.\n\nThe change was introduced with https://github.com/godotengine/godot/commit/3e20c1347db323438a76693bb9f7eea87f3a305d, before there was a >= 2 size comparison. (@clayjohn) ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godoten